Figure 2 depicts the distribution of associations as a function of distance to the nearest Synesthesia Battery endpoint, for Synesthesia Battery and SynesthesiaColorPicker data. The leftmost bar indicates the proportion of associations at the exact endpoint hues (exact HSL hue angle 0, 60, 120, 180, 240, or 300). Qualitatively, this bar is noticeably larger in the Synesthesia Battery data—consistent with the color picker design influencing behavior. Indeed, endpoint colors were chosen significantly more often in the Synesthesia Battery dataset than in the SynesthesiaColorPicker dataset (\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
