				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\mathrm{AUC}=0.76, z=5.11,p<0.001,\text{ AUC} 95\% \mathrm{CI} [0.66, 0.86]$$\end{document}AUC=0.76,z=5.11,p<0.001,AUC95%CI[0.66,0.86]); at the ideal threshold (maximizing sensitivity and specificity), sensitivity was 62.5% and specificity was 85.4%.
